{
  "id": "1JN.4",
  "number": "4",
  "bookId": "1JN",
  "reference": "1 John 4",
  "verseCount": 21,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "4",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "1JN 4"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "4",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, do not believe every spirit, but test the spirits to see whether they are of God; for many false prophets have gone out into the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "By this you know the Spirit of God: every spirit which confesses that Jesus Christ has come in the flesh is of God, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 2.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and every spirit which does not confess Jesus is not of God. This is the spirit of antichrist, of which you heard that it was coming, and now it is in the world already. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Little children, you are of God, and have overcome them; for he who is in you is greater than he who is in the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.15.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 15.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " They are of the world, therefore what they say is of the world, and the world listens to them. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.8.47"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 8.47",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " We are of God. Whoever knows God listens to us, and he who is not of God does not listen to us. By this we know the spirit of truth and the spirit of error.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 2.29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Beloved, let us love one another; for love is of God, and he who loves is born of God and knows God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He who does not love does not know God; for God is love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 3.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In this the love of God was made manifest among us, that God sent his only Son into the world, so that we might live through him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.15.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 15.12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.4.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 4.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "2.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In this is love, not that we loved God but that he loved us and sent his Son to be the expiation for our sins. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beloved, if God so loved us, we also ought to love one another. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.1.18"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 1.18",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " No man has ever seen God; if we love one another, God abides in us and his love is perfected in us.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.3.24"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 3.24",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " By this we know that we abide in him and he in us, because he has given us of his own Spirit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.4.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Jn 4.42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JHN.3.17"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "3.17",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And we have seen and testify that the Father has sent his Son as the Savior of the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever confesses that Jesus is the Son of God, God abides in him, and he in God. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So we know and believe the love God has for us. God is love, and he who abides in love abides in God, and God abides in him. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.28"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 2.28",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " In this is love perfected with us, that we may have confidence for the day of judgment, because as he is so are we in this world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There is no fear in love, but perfect love casts out fear. For fear has to do with punishment, and he who fears is not perfected in love. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.4.10"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 4.10",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " We love, because he first loved us. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1JN.2.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Jn 2.4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " If any one says, “I love God,” and hates his brother, he is a liar; for he who does not love his brother whom he has seen, cannot",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4.20",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Other ancient authorities read",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "how can he",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " love God whom he has not seen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1JN 4:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this commandment we have from him, that he who loves God should love his brother also.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1JN.4.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1JN.4.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
